# Vercel CLI deploys read THIS file, not .gitignore — a direct `vercel --prod`
# uploads the working directory, so anything large sitting here is uploaded
# even when git ignores it. 452 MB of PDFs in this folder failed the 100 MB
# per-file limit and blocked a deploy until this existed.
*.pdf
*.mov
*.zip

# Local scratch that has no business in a deployment.
content/incoming/
content/rental-incoming/
test-results/
playwright-report/
MOBILE_AUDIT_PLAN.md
INTEGRATION_PLAN.md
content-inventory.json
